{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Point In Time is an SF puzzle game where you solve challenges using time travel.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as the Retriever, traveling back to the past to retrieve technologies that have long gone extinct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is not something to be tampered with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you create a time paradox, everything ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Travel</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the power of time travel, you can make possible what is impossible in the present by returning to the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retrieve lost objects, access paths that were once unreachable, and uncover the solutions to each puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016500/extras/6c9c503ee4f24d272cd8125833012484.poster.avif?t=1770817678\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016500/extras/6c9c503ee4f24d272cd8125833012484.webm?t=1770817678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016500/extras/6c9c503ee4f24d272cd8125833012484.mp4?t=1770817678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperate With Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time travel allows you to work together with yourself from another point in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help your past self solve puzzles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and sometimes receive hints through messages across time left behind by your future self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique form of cooperation \u2014 alone, but never truly by yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016500/extras/f31b7a1b7b6c0ae51e4f6477e2da973c.poster.avif?t=1770817678\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016500/extras/f31b7a1b7b6c0ae51e4f6477e2da973c.webm?t=1770817678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016500/extras/f31b7a1b7b6c0ae51e4f6477e2da973c.mp4?t=1770817678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time Paradox</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What has already happened must happen exactly as it did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What did not happen must never happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a contradiction appears in the flow of time,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you will be erased from existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016500/extras/d871683d12b4f98982708ad2036bde09.poster.avif?t=1770817678\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016500/extras/d871683d12b4f98982708ad2036bde09.webm?t=1770817678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016500/extras/d871683d12b4f98982708ad2036bde09.mp4?t=1770817678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016500?t=1770817678","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016500?t=1770817678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/40165